cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "RoyalMD Gold Edition"
abstract: >-
  A lightweight OpenMM pipeline for protein-metal interface molecular dynamics.
  Builds an fcc metal slab from the INTERFACE model database, orients and
  immobilizes a protein on it, solvates with box vectors locked to the metal
  lattice, and runs minimization, multi-step equilibration and production with
  layer-selective restraints on the surface.
type: software
version: "1.6p"
date-released: 2026-09-19
